OL,3,GNEWSAHuntley murderer handed new whole
OL,4,Alife jail term
OL,5,
OL,6,FA triple killer who murdered the
OL,7,Fnotorious child-killer Ian Huntley in
OL,8,Fprison has been given a second whole
OL,9,Flife jail term.
OL,11,FAnthony Russell, 44, bludgeoned
OL,12,FHuntley, 52, to death with a metal bar
OL,13,Fat the high security Frankland Prison
OL,14,Fnear Durham in February, Newcastle
OL,15,FCrown Court heard.
OL,17,FRussell, who was jailed for life with
OL,18,Fno chance of parole in March 2022 for
OL,19,Fraping and murdering a pregnant woman
OL,20,Fand killing a mother and son in the
OL,21,FWest Midlands, admitted Huntley's
OL,22,Fmurder on the second day of his trial.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
